['Here's a simple implementation of what you asked for in C, focusing on data structures (arrays), logging, error handling and concurrency considerations. 

Please note that this is just a starting point and doesn't cover all your requirements completely, but it provides a good basis to work from. For production-grade code, more complex designs and optimizations are necessary:

